lls have the potential for long-lived in vivo protein secretion, which can be modeled in small animals.","topics":[],"score":223548,"global_rank":161309},{"name":"sungmoo89/sanfransico_bike_sharing","owner":"sungmoo89","html_url":"https://github.com/sungmoo89/sanfransico_bike_sharing","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":223548,"global_rank":161324},{"name":"silvanoross/Arbitrage_Analysis_2","owner":"silvanoross","html_url":"https://github.com/silvanoross/Arbitrage_Analysis_2","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Asset risk analysis","topics":[],"score":223548,"global_rank":161340},{"name":"hakhuong/Digital-Education-Market-Segmentation","owner":"hakhuong","html_url":"https://github.com/hakhuong/Digital-Education-Market-Segmentation","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Using clustering techniques to identify new market for Oppia Foundation's digital outreach based on education quality and internet access","topics":[],"score":223546,"global_rank":161367},{"name":"sam-thurman/tf_mnist_classification","owner":"sam-thurman","html_url":"https://github.com/sam-thurman/tf_mnist_classification","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"A classification solution for the MNIST dataset using Tensorflow","topics":[],"score":223546,"global_rank":161379},{"name":"leon-li-inspire/pytorch_learning_notes","owner":"leon-li-inspire","html_url":"https://github.com/leon-li-inspire/pytorch_learning_notes","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Learning notes for pytorch","topics":[],"score":223546,"global_rank":161416},{"name":"Jonny-T87/Books--Core-","owner":"Jonny-T87","html_url":"https://github.com/Jonny-T87/Books--Core-","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":nul